<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philipi Mingei</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIPI Mingei kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phili</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIPI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mingei Kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Philipi mingei kôma Tîrton Paul Lekhamuthuon</char> hih European rama Roman ramhuola Macedonia sunga Paul'n koiindang a phun masatak kôma miziek ani. Mahi tîrton intâng ina aom lâitak le Khristien sinthopu dang ngeiin ama an doina, ama khom bâiinkhama a om lâia le Philipi koiindanga khom minchûna dikloingei sika an beidong lâitaka miziek ani. Hankhoma hi lekhamuthuon hin Paul'n Jisua Khrista taksônna inthûktak vaiin kêng phûksânin râisânna le ngamriemna a rilminthâr thei ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hi lekhamuthuon a miziek ânrangna abi chu san anâng zora ama ranga neinunpêk an muthuon sika Philippia Khristienngei kôm râisânchongrilna ranga ani. A bâiinkhamna le an bâiinkhamna kâra khom hâina le ngamna an dôn theina rangin zorânchum hih anningei mindet nôknân a mang ani. Ranghuolna rokin le inpâkna jêka an om nêkin chu Jisua rangâiinchîna mulungrîl dôn rang a misîrpui ngei ani. Khrista leh inzoma an ringna hah Pathien lungkhamna neinunpêk, Judangei Balam tho ngâi balamngei an jôm sika an man niloiin, taksônna sika an man ani, ti hih a minriet nôk ngei ani. Khrista leh inzoma ringngei kai chu Pathien'n râisânna le inngêina a pêk ngâi tiin a miziek ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hi lekhamuthuon hih Khristien ringnuna taksônna, râisânna, ngamna, inruolna le doirâtnangei alieka minlut uolin sîn atho ani. Philipi koiindangngei ta ranga Paul moroina inthûk tie khom a minlang sa ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paul Misang Chungroi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista taka ringna <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1:27—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Timothy le Epaphroditus ranga mintuona <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Râlngei le chiruoingei renga inningnangei chong <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paul le Philipi taka a malngei <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chongkhârna <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Paul le Timothy, Khrista Jisua tîrlâmngei renga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Philipi khopuiliena Pathien mi Khrista Jisua taka inruol ngei, le koiindang ruoipungei le sintho sanpungei:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:12">Sin 16:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Pathien, ei Pa le Pumapa Jisua Khrista'n moroina le inngêina nangni pêk rese.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aporepungei ta ranga Paul chubaithona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Nangni ki mindon racham ka Pathien kôm râisânchong ki mintung ngâia; <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>nin rênga rangin chubai ko tho zora racham, kên zongna ngeia mulung râisânin asip ngâi ania <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>asikchu sûn motontak renga atûntena thurchisa phuong minzar sinthona hin mi nin la thop tit sikin. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Male nangma taka sin sa, Pathien'n nang a phutpui anghan, Khrista Jisua Nikhuo, nikhuo mongni dênin nang ruoi tit atih, tiin khom ki iempam ani. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Ku mulunga nin om tit ngâia! Hi anga nin chungroia adiktaka ki mindon rang piel khom ani. Atûna intâng ina ko om sûngin le thurchisa rung rang le adettaka ki minding lâi ngei han khom Pathien mi pêk zora sa ngei khom nin chang sa. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Ku mulungrîl tataka nangni ki ti ngei hih khom Jisua Khrista mulung renga nanâk ani, ti hih Pathien hih rietpuipu ani.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Nin lungkhamna hah, rietna diktak le roijêkna diktak leh ahong pung u-uol theina rangin chubai ko tho ngâi, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>masikin asatna nin thang thei ani. Hanchu, Khrista Nikhuoa han inthieng le demnaboi hongni nin tih. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Jisua Khrista vaiin a pêk thei, nin ringna hah satna diktakin nangni minsip atih, Pathien roiinpuina rang le minpâkna rangin.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista ranga ring</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Ku sûngsuokngei, ku chunga neinun hongtung ngei hah thurchisa minzarna taka mi san tatak ani ti nin riet rang ku nuom. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Khrista tîrlâm ki ni sikin intâng ina minkhum ti hih munpui rungpungei nâm le midang hitaka om ngei nâmin an riet zoi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Sin 28:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Male intâng ina kên tâng sika ei khristien champui tamtak ngeiin Pumapa taka phûkdâiin an oma, an ngam teteta chiloi riekin Pathien thurchi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thurchi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih miziek senkhat ngei chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien thurchi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn</char></note> an misîr zoi.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Ani, senkhatin chu Khrista thurchi hih keima mi narsana sika le mi makhalna sikin an misîra, aniatachu adangngeiin chu mulungbôk diktakin an misîr ngâi. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Hi ngei hin chu thurchisa muphuong rang piela Pathien'n sintum mi pêk ani ti rietpumin, lungkhamna sika misîr ngâi an ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Senkhat ngeiin chu Khrista thurchi hih, ranghuolna mulungbôk ratha mangin, jêlina ko om sûngin mi minjêl sabak rangin an mindon ani.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Hannisenla ite injêl mak! asikchu, asa khomin, asie khomin, ikhomnirese Khrista thurchi an misîr sikin ka râiasân ani. Ma angdên han râiminsân tit ki tih, <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>nin chubaithona sika le Jisua Khrista renga Ratha sanna sikin mojôkin la om ki tih, ti ki riet ani. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Masikin ko ôina inthûktak le sabeina chu ki sintum châi tet loiin, aliekin atûn lâitak le zoratina khom hâina sipin ko om theia, ringna nirse, thina nirse, ka takpumpui leh Khrista kôm miritna ki mintung theina rangin. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Aring hih imo ania? Ka ta rangin chu Khrista ani. Hanchu, thi hih inlâpna mintung uol atih. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Aniatachu ka la ringin chu chuonsin kâmom la sin uol thei ki tih, aniatachu kho tak hi mo ka thang rang riet thei mu-ung. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Kâng inikin kaiphirînin ko om ani. Hi ringnun hih mâkin Khrista leh om ta rong chu ko jôt tataka, ma neinun ha asa uol ok ani; <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>aniatachu nangni jâra aringa ka la om hi kâmnâng uol ok ani. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Mahi tak ko sônchêt sikin ka la om rang ti ki rieta, nin taksônna han masônna le râisânna nangni bôk pe rangin nin rênga nin kôm ka la om bang rang, <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>masikin nin kôm ko hong tika, Khrista leh inzoma ring nin ni, tiin mi nin minpâkna abi nin dôn uol theina rang ani.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Atûna, nin ringnunna neinun kâmnâng tak chu Khrista thurchisa'n anânglam angtak hah nîng atih, masikin nangni ko hong en theiin khom, en theiloiin khoma, thurchisa taksônna rangin neinunkhîn munkhat le ôina munkhata inding deta doi nin ni, tiin lei riet thei ki tih. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Nin râlngei chi no ungla; zoratin hâitakin om roi, male mahi an ta rangin dokna rang ani tiin minlangna nîng a ta, nin rât rang ania, mahi Pathien'n menêna nangni pêk sikin ani. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Khrista sin tho ranga zora sa pêkin nin oma, ama nin iem vai niloiin, tuongsa rang khom phal nin ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Sin 16:19-40</ref></char></note> Atûn indoina takah ko kôm nin kop thei zoi. Zora vunsaia indoina kên doipui nin mu ngâi angdên ha, atûn tena khom ka lân doipui bang nin riet anghan.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Khrista rangâiinchîna le inlalna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Khrista taka nin ringna han nangni a min râta, male a lungkhamna han nin ratha a minngama. Ratha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ratha leh inlopkhômna nin dôna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ratha han inkhat le inkhat inlopkhômna han nangni a hong tuong.</char></note> leh inlopkhômna nin dôna, inkhat le inkhat inriengmuna le inkan inlômna nin dôn ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Hanchu mindona munkhat dônin, lungkhamna munkhata insem suom rangin, mulungrîl le ratha munkhata omin ka râisânna mikhipphar rangin nangni ke ngên ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Ranghuolna oîna renga aninônchu insongna ôinangei renga ite sin no ungla, inkhat le inkhat chunga rangâiinchîna dônin zoratin nangni nanâk nêkin mi dangngei asa uolin be roi. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Male nangni nin nuomlam vai en loiin mi dangngei an nuomlam khom en sa roi. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Hi mulungbôk nin dôn rang hih Khrista Jisua'n a dôn hah ani:<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Ama chu zoratin Pathien nina a dôna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">aniatachu rangrâtin Pathien leh inangbanga ombang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ombang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hongni.</char></note> rangin pût rang mindon mak.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Hima nêkin, ama lungdôn a dônngei murdi a mâk rieia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">male tîrlâm nina hah a lâk zoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Miriem angin a juong oma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">male miriem mêl angin ânlang zoi.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Ama chu rangâiinchînin chongjômna lampuia a lôna, thina lampuingei dênrakin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">khros chunga a thina hah.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Masika han Pathien'n ama chu mun insângtak chunga a domsânga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">male riming dang dangngei nêkin riming inchungtak a pêk zoi.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10,11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Masikin, Jisua riming miritnân</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">invâna omngei murdi, pilchunga omngei, le rammuol nuoia omngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">rammuol nuoia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ajîngna nuoia rammuola han mithi ngei ha an la ring bang rangin mindon ani.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">khûk an inbilna rangin,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>male mitinin Jisua Khrista hih Pumapa ani tiin ânlangin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Pa, Pathien roiinpuina rangin phuong an tih.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vârngei anghan rammuola vâr rang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Masikin, ruol moroitakngei, nin kôm ko om lâia zoratin ko chong nin don ngâi anghan, atûn nin kôm ko om loi kâr hin vâng chu nin don uol rang anâng ani. Chi le innîk pumin nin sanminringna minzoi rangin sintho tit ungla, <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>a neinunkhîn nin jôm theina rang le nin sin nuomna rangin Pathien'n zoratin nin sûnga sin a tho sikin. <verse eid="PHP 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Neinuntin chierna le inkhalna boiin tho roi, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Bal 32:5</ref></char></note> han kêng hi rammuola mi nunsiengei le murûkmeret tho ngei lâia Pathien nâi diktak, sietnaboi le inthienghieia om anghan nin ni duoi thei, ârsingeiin invân an êlminvâr angin an lâia nin vâr ngêt rang, <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>an kôm ringna chongbe nin pêk ngei anghan. Ha anghan nin thôn chu, Khrista Nikhuo han ke dengtheina le sinthona ngei murdi mâkana chang mak, tiin minlang theiin nangni minpâk theina rang abi dôn thei ki tih. <verse eid="PHP 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Ani, ki ringna thisen hih nin taksônna inbôlna ngei Pathien kôm nin pêk angin, bunpai rang nikhom ronga ka râiasâna male ka râisânna nin rêngin nangni kên sempui sa ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Ma angdên han, nangni khom nin râiminsân ngêt ungla, kei khom nin râisânna mên sempui sa roi.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Timothy le Epaphroditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Masikin nin roi ki rieta mohôkin ko om theina rangin Pumapa lungdo anînchu, Timothy hih nin kôm hongtîr lai thei rangin kên sabei ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Ama vai hih ki mindona mên sempui ngâi le nin chungroi adiktaka donsûi ngâi ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Adangngei nâm chu an siksika rang vai an mindona Jisua Khrista rangin chu mindon mak ngei. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Male ama chu alut tie minsina aom hah nangni rengin nin rieta, ama le keima hih kho angin mo kin ni, nâipasal le a pa angin kin nia, thurchisa rang jâra munkhata sintho ngâi kin ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Masikin keima rangin neinunngei kho angin mo a hong inhei ki riet lehan nin kôm hongtîr kelen rangin ka sabei ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Male keima reng khom nin kôm ânranga hong thei rangin Pumapa han iemna ko dôn ani.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Ki sinthopui le ki tienga mi doipui ngâi, nin tîrton anga sintho, mi san ngâipu ei lâibungpa Epaphroditus hih nin kôm hongtîr rang anâng tiin mindona ko dôn ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Ama hih nin rêngin nangni mu rang a jôt sabaka, a damloi nin riet sikin ânngûikhak ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Ataktakin ama chu damloiin a thi vânga. Aniatachu Pathien'n inrieng a mua, ama chung vai niloiin, keima khom inngûina lien uola ko om loina rangin mi thop sa ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Masikin ama nin mu tika nin râisân nôkna rang le ka inngûina ânmang theina rangin nin kôm hongtîr rang ka ngâklal sabak ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Pumapa jârin ama hah lâibungpa anghan râisânin lei modôm roi. Ama anghan mingei murdi kôm miritna minlang ungla, <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>nangni'n sanna mi nin pêk thei loi, mi pêk rangin Khrista chuonsina jâra a thi vâng dôr a ringna phalin alei inpêk sikin.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Dikna tatak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Chongkhârnân, ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, Pumapa leh nin inzomna han nin râiminsân roi. Motona ke lei mizieksai avêla miziek hih kei rangin ningchiel om nimaka, ma anga ko tho hah nangni rangin ânlâp uol ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Neinun saloi tho ngei, uingei, taksa mortan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">taksa mor tan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sertan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khom ei ti thei</char></note> lunghâng tho mingei renga han indîn roi. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Anni ngei niloiin, eini ngei hih ama Ratha jâra Pathien chubaimûk ngei le Khrista Jisua leh inzoma ringna râisânna man ngei hih kêng sertan diktak eini. Eini chu pêntieng neinuna ei taksônna minngam mak me. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Nuom ronga chu kei khom ma anga neinunngei chunga taksônna minngam thei kêng ki ni. Mi dang ngeiin pêntienga neinuna an taksônna minngam theiin an mindonin chu, keima vâng chu ma lampui han ma nêkin abi ko dôn uol ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Haptakhat ki ni han sertan ki ni. Israelmia inzir ki nia, Benjamin jât mi, Hebrew thisen inthienghiei ki ni. Juda Balam jûina tieng chu Pharisee ki nia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Sin 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>male koiindang nuomlona tieng asân ningsiet ngâi ke lei ni. Miriemin Balam chongpêkngei jôma adik chang theina tieng chu demnaboi ki ni. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Sin 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Aniatachu inlâpna ranga ke tel thei neinunngei murdi hah atûn hin Khrista jârin machânin ke be zoi ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Ma neinunngei vai hah niloiin; ku Pumapa Khrista Jisua rietna luttak jârin neinun murdi khom machân rieiin ke be zoia; ama jârin neinun murdi ko vôrpai leta, Khrista ka man theina rangin mangei nâm hah ânnim, ânnok anghan ke be zoia, <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>male ama leh inpumkhat tatakna rangin. Balam jôm sika man thei ngâi jât dikna hah keima hin dôn khâi mu-ung. Atûn chu taksônna chunga ânngam, Pathien renga hongsuok ngâi dikna, Khrista taksôn sika pêka om ngâi hah ko dôn zoi ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Anrênga ku nuom tak chu Khrista rieta, ânthoinôkna sinthotheina riet mindika, a tuongnangei tuongpuia, a thina angin thi rang hih ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Keimananâk khom thina renga inthoia, ring rangin insabei ki ni.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tenkung tienga tân</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Keima chu ko zoisai ke ani zoi, aninônchu achukphar ko hongni zoi ki tina khom nimak. Khrista Jisua'n ama nanâkin mi lei mansaina râisânman hah ka man thei duoi mo tiin ku rujûl ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Ani, ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, adiktakin ka man saiin la mindon mu-ung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">la mindon mu-ung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu mahih </char><char style="fq" closed="false">la mindon tak mu-ung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn ani</char></note> nikhomrese, neinun khat ko tho ngâi chu, ku nûktienga om neinunngei mingilin motontienga om neinunngei phâk rangin ka pharidôr ko tho ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Masikin râisânman man rangin tenkung tieng ânjîkzatin ka tâna, hima hih Khrista Jisua sika chungtienga ringna Pathien koina ani.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Eini ratha taka mitungsuo ngeiin ei rêngin hima anga mulungrîl munkhat hih ei dôn rang ani. Aniatachu mi senkhatin mulungrîl dang nin dôn duoiin chu Pathien'n nin kôm la minthâr atih. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Maha kho angin khom nirse, atûn tena ei lei jûisai balamngei dungjûiin motontieng panin se ei ti u.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Kor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11:1</ref></char>
    </note>Ka champuingei, ku nunchan inchupungei ni roi. Nangni ranga minenna dik kin dar ajûipungei hah lunghâng tho ngei roi. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Mi tamtak ringnun hah Khrista khros chunga a thina râlin a sin ngeia, tiin motona vêltamtak nangni ke lei ril angin, atûn khom avêlin mitrithi tâkpumin: nangni ki ril ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Anningei sêna hah amongna chu meidil ania, an pathien hah an taksa ôinangei ani sikin. An inzakna rang hah an inpâkpuia, male hi rammuol neinunngei vai hih an mindon ngâi ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Nikhomrese, eini chu invân mingei einia, ei Sanminringpu Pumapa Jisua Khrista invân renga a juong rang ôtlaltakin ei ngâk ani. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>A sinthotheina mangin neinun murdi ama racham nuoia hongchôi thei han, ei takpum thithei adokngei hih thûlin ama takpum roiinpuitak angin minchang ngei atih.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Rilnangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Masikin, ka lâibungngei le sarnungei, keima rangin idôra moroiom le ka rangâi ngei mo nin ni zoi! Nangni jâra idôrmo ka râisân le minpâka om mo ki ni zoi! Hanchu mahi, moroiomtak lâibungngei le sarnungei, Pumapa taka han nin ringna nin minding det rang ani.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Euodia le Syntyche, rangâihoitakin, Pumapa han zuorpuisa anghan jôt inruol rangin nin pût rangin nangni ke ngên. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Nangma, ka champui taksônom tak khom, hi nupangngei hih na san ngei rangin ko jôt sa; thurchisa phuong minzarna sinthona han Clement le ki sintho champui adadangngei, Pathien ringna lekhabua an riming chuongngei lehan munkhata intaktakin sin min thopui ngâi sikin.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Zoratin Pumapa leh nin inpumkhatna han nin râiminsân roi. Ti nôk ki tih; nin râiminsân roi!<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Mitin chunga nin nuninnêmna minlang roi. Pumapa chu a juong lai rang kêng. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Ite chungroia nin kângmindoi no ungla, hannirese nin chubaithona murdia imo nin nâng Pathien kôm zong ungla, mulung râisântakin a kôm zong tit ngâi roi. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Hanchu Pathien'n inngêina, munisi ngeiin an riet phâk ngâiloi, Khrista Jisua leh nin inzomnân nin mulungrîlngei le nin mulungbôkngei hah aringin nangni a dar pe rang ani.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Chongkhârnân, ka ruolngei, asa le minpâkna manrangrohoi neinunngei lehan nin mulungbôkngei hah minsip ungla: hima neinunngei hah, atak, misang asa nina, adik, ânthieng, miditruoi, le miritom ngei hah an ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Keima renga anruona, ko chongbâingei renga le ki sinthongei renga nin inchu le nin manngei hah tho rangin inchu ngâi roi. Male inngêina mi pêkpu Pathien hah nangni ompui rang ani.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Neinunpêk sika râisânchongrilna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Ki ringnun hin Pumapa leh inzomin zora sôttak suonûkin keima ranga nin mindona vêl khat hong minlang nôk thei rangin zorânchum nin dôn sikin kei rangin râisânna lientak ani. Mi nin mindona hah nin mong zoi ki tina nimaka, a minlang rang zorânchum nin dôn loia kêng ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Mahi lunghâng nin tho loi sika ki ti nimaka, ko dôn chunga mulungchuka om rang kên chusai sika ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Imo ahong nâng rang, imo ahundôr nêka atam dôn rang khom ki riet. Hi omlam inthup hih kên chua, masikin, kho muna khom, kho zora khom, khopin mo aninônchu vonchâmin mo, dôn mintam okin mo, atômte ko dôn khomin ku mulung achuk ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Khrista'n mi pêk, sinthotheina han intaknangei nâm hah tong theina ranak ko dôn zoi.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Aniatachu ke dengtheina ngeia mi nin san hih nin tho minsa sabak ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Nangni Philipi mingei, Thurchi Sa misîra aom phut nikhuo ngeia Macedonia ram ka mâk lâihan nangni nin koiindang vai ke mi san nin ni; nangni inkhat vai kêng ka âikalnangei le ki insûmnangei mên sempui ngâi ninni, tiin nin riet minthâr sabak ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Sin 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Thessalonica sûnga ko om lâia, voikhat nêka tam sanna ka nâng han, mi nin hong muthuona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Kor 11:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Neinunpêk man rang ko jôt vai niloiin; manêk han, nangni tienga âikalna molopa aom mu rang ko jôt ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Hanchu, mahi, neinun mi nin pêk ngei murdi ka manna lêkha ani, male ahundôr nêka tam aom zoi! Epaphroditus'n nin neinunpêkngei anrêngin mi hongchôi pea, atûn chu ka nâng nâm ko dôn zoi. Mangei hah mirimhoi Pathien kôma pêk, inbôlna a pomtheiruo le a lungdo angin an ni. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Jôk 29:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Ka Pathien'n nin nângngei murdi Khrista Jisua renga, a neina ânniengrakin nangni a pêk bang rang ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Ei Pathien le Pa kôm han tuonsôt tuonsôtin roiinpuina om rese! Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoina chibaimûkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Jisua Khrista taka, Pathien mingei murdi hah chibai mi mûk pe roi. Hi taka keima leh om ei lâibungngei le sarnungei chibai nangni an hong muthuon ani. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Hi taka Pathien mingei murdi'n chibai an hong muthuona, aliekin Rêng ina ompu ngei hin.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Pumapa Jisua Khrista moroina hah nin rênga nin kôm om rese!<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
